:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Encounter

<<if !_harbourNight or !_harbour.event>>
  <<deadwood-harbour-result>>
<<else>>
  <<switch _harbour.event>>
    <<case 'hostile'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Two waterlogged figures in rotted deck clothes are prising open a barnacled crate with rusted iron hooks. At the wet scrape of your footsteps, they turn in eerie unison. Freezing brine and black silt drip from their pale, bloated faces. <span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">"...Cargo... leave what ye carry..."</span> One lunges forward with water-rotted fingers, reaching straight for your clothes.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          两个身裹破烂水手服、浑身透湿的身影正用生锈的铁钩撬着一只附满藤壶的木箱。听到你被浸湿的脚步声，他们僵硬而诡异地一同转过头。冰冷的海水与黑沉的泥沙顺着他们苍白浮肿的面孔不断滴落。<span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">“……货……把身上的东西留下……”</span>其中一人猛地扑上前来，满是腐水的手指径直抓向你的衣衫。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'chase'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "A live one... warm blood... don't let <<phim>> get away!" You whip around at the rasping shriek. A shadowy figure drops a sodden hemp sack and sprints at you with uncanny speed. More drowned pirates look up from the gaping, rotted warehouse doors. Soaked boots pound like muffled thunder along the creaking pier as they spread out across the mist to box you in.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “那儿有个活的……热腾腾的血肉……别让<<phim>>跑了！”粗粝刺耳的尖叫声撕破浓雾，你猛地回头。一道阴影丢下沉重的湿麻袋，以不可思议的速度朝你狂奔而来。破败腐烂的货仓门后，更多溺毙海盗的身影抬起头来。湿透的皮靴如沉闷的鼓点砸在吱呀作响的栈桥上，他们在海雾中迅速散开，企图封死你所有的退路。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'voice'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A heavy, hollow thump shudders through the timber pier right beneath your feet. <span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">"...Hold fast the rope... don't let the ballast sink..."</span> Cold, swollen grey fingers force their way through the narrow gaps in the salt-eaten planks. An iron grip catches the edge, splintering the rot-softened wood beside your boot with unnatural, frantic strength.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          脚下被盐水侵蚀的木栈桥猛地传来一声沉闷而剧烈的撞击，震得你脚底发麻。<span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">“……拉紧绳子……别让沉底的压舱箱掉下去……”</span>几根冰冷、肿胀发灰的手指硬生生从腐朽的木板缝隙中挤了出来。一只死人手死死抠住木板边缘，以狂乱而惊人的力道猛地一掀，你脚边的木料瞬间崩裂开来。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'lucid'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if _harbour.exchanged>>
            A pirate sorts old coins on an overturned chest. You have seen how carefully the dead guard their cargo, and stop short of the lid. <span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">"...Looking won't earn ye any."</span> A pale hand gathers the money beneath a torn sleeve.
          <<elseif _harbour.spoke>>
            An overturned chest scrapes against the quay. A pirate settles on it and begins counting coins. Beyond the fog, you hear the same loading orders you heard on an earlier visit. "Got something to trade, or are ye just watching?"
          <<else>>
            A pirate sits on an overturned chest, sorting old coins with stiff fingers. Water drips from a torn coat. <span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">"...Found anything worth trading?"</span> A pale hand covers the nearest pile. "Bring something of yer own. Don't touch me cargo."
          <</if>>
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if _harbour.exchanged>>
            一个海盗在翻倒的木箱上整理旧硬币。你领教过这些死人护着货物的脾气，没往箱盖前凑。<span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">“……光看可挣不到钱。”</span>一只苍白的手把钱拢进破袖子底下。
          <<elseif _harbour.spoke>>
            翻倒的木箱在石地上刮出一声响。一个海盗坐上去，开始数钱。雾里又传来装货的号令，和你上次听见的一样。“有东西换，还是光站着看？”
          <<else>>
            一个海盗坐在翻倒的木箱上，用僵硬的手指整理旧硬币。海水顺着破外套滴下来。<span @class="'purple ' + basicHypnoCss()">“……捞到什么值钱的东西了吗？”</span>一只苍白的手盖住最近的钱堆。“拿你自己的东西来换，别碰我的货。”
          <</if>>
      <</language>>
  <</switch>><br><br>
  <<if _harbour.event is 'lucid'>>
    <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/ghost-ship.png'>><<lanLink ['Ask about the ship (0:05)', '问问那艘船 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Sailor'>>
      <<pass 5>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
      <<if _harbourNight and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>><<set _harbour.spoke to true>><</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
    <<if !_harbour.spoke and maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.active>>
      <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/ghost-ship.png'>><<lanLink ['Stay to hear the rest (0:10)', '留下来听海盗说完 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Sailor'>>
        <<if !$MoreTransformations.harbour.spoke and $MoreTransformations.harbour.event is 'lucid' and maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.active>>
          <<pass 10>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
          <<if _harbourNight and _harbour.event is 'lucid' and !_harbour.spoke and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
            <<set _harbour.spoke to true, _harbour.scene to 'sailor_deep'>>
            <<run maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.change(-100, 150)>>
          <</if>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><<llsanity>><<ggfear>><br>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>>
    <<sneakicon>><<lanLink ['Slip behind the fishing nets (0:02)', '躲进渔网后 (0:02)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Fight'>>
      <<pass 2>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
      <<if _harbourNight and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 400>><<skulduggerycheck 'silent'>><<skulduggeryuse>>
        <<set _harbour.scene to $skulduggerysuccess is 1 ? 'evaded' : 'caught'>>
        <<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>><<set _harbour.event to ''>><<run maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.change(0, -100)>><</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>><br>
    <<runicon>><<lanLink ['Run for the harbour steps (0:02)', '跑向港湾石阶 (0:02)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Fight'>>
      <<pass 2>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
      <<if _harbourNight and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<athletics 1>>
        <<set _harbour.scene to currentSkillValue('athletics') gte random(200, 700) ? 'escaped' : 'caught'>>
        <<if _harbour.scene is 'escaped'>><<set _harbour.event to ''>><<run maplebirch.get('Psyche')?.change(0, -100)>><</if>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><<athleticsdifficulty 200 700>><br>
    <<icon 'alert.png'>><<lanLink ['Stand your ground', '留下来反抗'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Fight'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<br><<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave the harbour (0:05)', '离开港湾 (0:05)'] 'Mer Street'>>
  <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.event to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to ''>><<pass 5>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Sailor
<<location 'seadocks'>><<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _harbourNight and _harbour.event is 'lucid'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The pirate turns a coin between stiff fingers. "That ship goes where there's plunder. When the red fog comes over the wall, we come ashore. First light, and the curse pulls us back down." A crash comes from the warehouses. The pirate glances towards it. "Keep clear of me mates. They've forgotten how to bargain."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      海盗用僵硬的手指转着一枚硬币。“那艘船，有油水的地方就去。红雾漫过防波堤，我们就上岸。天一亮，诅咒又把我们拖回海底。”货仓那边传来一声巨响。海盗朝那边看了一眼。“离我的伙计们远点。他们早忘了怎么谈买卖。”
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if _harbour.zephyr.stage is 4>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You remember the red cord on Zephyr's recovered chest. This pirate has tied a strip of sailcloth around a crate instead. The hand resting on its lid does not move when you look at it.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你想起交还给泽菲尔的箱子，上面扎着红绳。眼前这个海盗却用破帆布捆住货箱。你看过去时，那只按着箱盖的手一动不动。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<elseif _harbour.exchanged>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You remember the trinket you traded on an earlier visit. The pirate follows your glance towards the coins and folds both arms over the chest. "Cargo's mine till there's a deal. Keep yer hands off."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你想起先前换出去的旧物。海盗顺着你的目光低头看了一眼，把双臂压在箱盖上。“没谈好价，东西就还是我的。管好你的手。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if _harbour.scene is 'sailor_deep'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The pirate keeps talking after you have stopped asking questions. Names of ships, barrels counted, orders repeated. At some point, the voice is coming from beneath the chest as well. You look down. A second set of wet footprints ends against your shoes. The pirate's pale hand reaches across the lid, and you step back before it can close around yours.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你不再问了，海盗却还在说。船名，酒桶的数目，一遍遍重复的号令。不知什么时候，箱子底下也传出了同样的声音。你低头看去，另一串湿脚印正抵着你的鞋尖。海盗苍白的手越过箱盖，你赶在它握住你之前退开了。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if _harbour.relics gt 0 and !_harbour.exchanged>>
    <<icon 'coldmoon-harbour/salvage-trade.png'>><<lanLink ['Trade a recovered trinket for £10 (0:05)', '打捞旧物换£10 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Exchange'>>
      <<pass 5>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
      <<if _harbourNight and _harbour.event is 'lucid' and _harbour.relics gt 0 and !_harbour.exchanged and !$nextPassage and !$nextPassageCheck>>
        <<set _harbour.relics -= 1, _harbour.exchanged to true, $money += 1000>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<<else>><<deadwood-harbour-result>><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Step back towards the lamps', '退回灯光下'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour'>>
  <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.event to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to ''>>
<</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour Exchange
<<location 'seadocks'>><<effects>><<deadwood-harbour-context>>
<<if $nextPassage or $nextPassageCheck>>
  <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] $passage>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if _harbourNight and _harbour.exchanged>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The pirate scrapes dirt from the trinket with a fingernail and holds it to the moonlight. "...Been down there a while." A few old coins slide across the chest. You take the money and hand over the keepsake. The pirate puts it inside the wet coat and covers the remaining coins.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      海盗用指甲刮去旧物上的泥，举起来对着月光看了看。“……在底下泡了不少年。”几枚旧硬币被推过箱盖。你收好钱，将旧物递过去。海盗把它塞进湿外套，又用手盖住剩下的钱。
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>><<deadwood-harbour-result>><</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to the harbour steps', '返回港湾石阶'] 'Deadwood Coldmoon Harbour'>>
  <<set $MoreTransformations.harbour.event to '', $MoreTransformations.harbour.scene to ''>>
<</lanLink>><br>
